{"steam_appid":2110820,"steam_name":"Granny Remake","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2110820/588451/8ab5db9ddef2b6985d461b7d5ae11a86608b9b43/1751077451/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1689652502","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256958695/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1689652502","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/ss_f0cc76ba4548448dfeda57634e4caaf3d09bc0a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781625684","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/ss_6e1f89a4f554890c768479595e9aab20ec4b9d56.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781625684","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/ss_3f1fc828d51199bdcc94bf50c5d5c514b8d4b0e7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781625684","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/ss_da992963f19493c26fa4ad8e81cabfeaf717a827.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781625684","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/ss_9c21c2ae9d03cf0d3f38fd0e5a332b28b4ee504b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781625684"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Can You Escape Granny's Sinister House?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dive into a heart-pounding horror experience where every decision could be your last.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏚️ UNCOVER THE MYSTERIES OF A HOUSE TEEMING WITH SECRETS AND PERILS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Environments:</strong> Traverse from shadowy basements to ominous attics, each filled with secrets waiting to be discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Visuals:</strong> Stunning graphics and meticulous details draw you deeper into the chilling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/fe0dbbeab65e1eccfa666f09c301c056.poster.avif?t=1781625684\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/fe0dbbeab65e1eccfa666f09c301c056.webm?t=1781625684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/fe0dbbeab65e1eccfa666f09c301c056.mp4?t=1781625684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 SOLVE DIVERSE PUZZLES AND OVERCOME CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Brain Teasers:</strong> Solve the cuckoo clock puzzle, use the metal detector to find hidden items, and test your aim in the attic shooting gallery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vital Tools:</strong> Locate essential items like the flare gun and phone to outsmart Granny and secure your escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/d7b1aed2f4b0e5997d8ea0fcf6d49586.poster.avif?t=1781625684\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/d7b1aed2f4b0e5997d8ea0fcf6d49586.webm?t=1781625684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/d7b1aed2f4b0e5997d8ea0fcf6d49586.mp4?t=1781625684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚪 CHOOSE YOUR ROUTE TO FREEDOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flee by Car:</strong> Assemble the missing parts and speed away from terror. <br><strong>Summon Rescue:</strong> Signal for help using the flare gun and phone to bring authorities to your aid. <br><strong>Break Through the Front Door:</strong> Uncover keys and tools to make your escape through the main entrance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/2cf722b69a802a18891ebfd43754d1cf.poster.avif?t=1781625684\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/2cf722b69a802a18891ebfd43754d1cf.webm?t=1781625684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/2cf722b69a802a18891ebfd43754d1cf.mp4?t=1781625684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 HEART-STOPPING GAMEPLAY AGAINST A RELENTLESS FOE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive AI Enemy:</strong> Granny hears every whisper, senses your presence, and pursues you without mercy.<br><strong>Advanced Stealth Mechanics:</strong> Move silently, peek around corners, and use the environment to stay hidden. <br><strong>Unpredictable Threats:</strong> Stay vigilant—danger can strike unexpectedly from anywhere.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/8df8606710fe2658dc7e2dacbaf563fa.poster.avif?t=1781625684\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/8df8606710fe2658dc7e2dacbaf563fa.webm?t=1781625684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/8df8606710fe2658dc7e2dacbaf563fa.mp4?t=1781625684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔊 IMMERSIVE AUDIO THAT AMPLIFIES THE HORROR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Sounds:</strong> Realistic sound effects amplify the suspense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Soundtrack:</strong> Dynamic music intensifies during critical moments, pulling you deeper into the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/6eb5414d07625f0631339cfddd608212.poster.avif?t=1781625684\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/6eb5414d07625f0631339cfddd608212.webm?t=1781625684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2110820/extras/6eb5414d07625f0631339cfddd608212.mp4?t=1781625684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are You Ready to Face Your Fears?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy now and dive into the nightmare. Your escape begins here.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Join Our Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect</strong> with other players, <strong>share</strong> strategies, and <strong>get</strong> <strong>the</strong> <strong>latest</strong> <strong>news</strong> on our <strong>Discord server or Telegram</strong>.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050TI<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The minimum PC components on which the game was tested*. The game will be able to run smoothly on lower performance</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5-2600 | Intel i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RX 570 | GTX 1060 | 3GB+ Vram<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> no</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["FerriteLabs"],"publishers":["FerriteLabs"],"release_date":"19 Jul, 2023"}